          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "DeepMind's David Silver raises $1.1B to build AI that learns without any human-generated data",
            "articleSection": "Discovery & Research",
            "abstract": "Ineffable Intelligence, a British AI lab founded just months ago by former DeepMind researcher David Silver — the scientist behind AlphaGo — has raised $1.1 billion at a $5.1 billion valuation. The lab's stated goal is to build AI systems that can learn entirely without human-generated training data, a fundamental departure from how most current AI models are built. If successful, the approach could remove one of the core bottlenecks in AI development: the finite and often biased supply of human-labelled data.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/27/deepminds-david-silver-just-raised-1-1b-to-build-an-ai-that-learns-without-human-data/",
            "publisher": {
